<title>NETHERLANDS: ING no comment on ANZ talk.</title>
<headline>ING no comment on ANZ talk.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-07-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Financial services group ING Groep NV (ING) on Friday declined to comment on speculation it was interested in buying Australia and New Zealand Banking Group Ltd.</p>
<p>&quot;You know we don't comment on rumours,&quot; a spokeswoman for the Dutch banking and insurance group told Reuters.</p>
<p>ANZ's share price rose strongly on Thursday on rumours that Australia's Foreign Investment Review Board had approved a takeover of the Australian bank.</p>
<p>Banks touted as potential suitors included ING and National Westminster Bank Plc.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
